ted_internal | All G1–G18 retain work; bounded reference checks do not establish accounting or forecast validity. |\n| P01 — Prepare source-context and availability work records | accepted_internal | Publication/version evidence, semantic annotation, incorporated packages and benchmark labels remain open. |\n| P02 — Complete the bounded Apple case preparation | accepted_internal | The previous structured review returned AGREE, but its process record reports timeout; supervisor acceptance remains pending.; Complete note semantics, remaining indentures, series certificates and omitted instruments remain unresolved through specific recorded source routes.; Historical retained-byte availability and whole-document representation equivalence remain unestablished.; Debt/swap allocation, noncash movements, asset cohorts and contingent outcomes remain unidentified.; Selected identities do not establish full accounting validity, empirical forecast validity or human acceptance. All G1–G18 retain wider obligations.; Two temporary-file tests could not be independently rerun in this read-only environment; their passing status relies on the matching supervisor check record and inspected test code.; Complete agreement semantics, remaining indentures, series certificates and omitted instruments remain unresolved through specific recorded source routes.; Historical availability of retained bytes and whole-document representation equivalence remain unestablished.; Selected reconciliations establish neither full-company accounting validity nor empirical forecast validity. Human acceptance remains pending; all G1–G18 retain wider obligations.; This review changed no files. |\n| P03 — Implement source lowering and shared IR | accepted_internal | General language support, arbitrary and cross-company mappings, and broader uncertainty remain incomplete; G2, G12 and G15 remain open.; Accounting validity, empirical forecast validity, authoring superiority and human acceptance are not established.; Git provenance remains unavailable; recorded content hashes provide file provenance.; General package loading and overrides, events, postings, journals, runtime execution, arbitrary mappings, multiple entities/books/observations, currencies/calendars, cross-company mappings and broader uncertainty remain unsupported.; In-place checker execution was blocked by the read-only workspace; the same checker passed in a disposable writable copy with only expected temporary-path and timing differences. |\n| P04 — Implement reconstruction and numerical operations | accepted_internal | Independent acceptance remains pending; the previous timed-out review does not establish acceptance.; Arbitrary-history completeness, nonlinear inference, continuous probabilistic inference, unbounded integer search and general aggregation equivalence remain unsupported.; Accounting validity, empirical forecast validity and human acceptance remain unestablished. MC01–MC35 and G1–G18 retain wider obligations.; Four P04 checker tests and two P03 checker tests were not independently rerun in this read-only review; their passing status relies on matching recorded checks and inspected test code.; Template discovery, arbitrary-history completeness, nonlinear inference, continuous probabilistic inference, unbounded integer search and general aggregation equivalence remain unsupported.; Admission records do not establish evidence truth or professional accounting eligibility.; Accounting validity, empirical forecast validity and human acceptance remain unestablished; MC01–MC35 and G1–G18 retain wider obligations.; This review changed no files. |\n| P05 — Execute the bounded company path | running |  |\n| P06 — Enforce context, chronology and resolution | pending |  |\n| P07 — Implement review, persistence and recovery | pending |  |\n| P08 — Resolve authority and corporate-method obligations | needs_repair |  |\n| P09 — Extend bank methods | pending |  |\n| P10 — Extend insurance methods | pending 